hysicist, engineer, and inventor, his work laid foundational principles that would resonate for millennia.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHqvIrJGQO3LgV3VdlQwg23Du09Y7bicrDbmUDnrRzM4Ydn95FSBVp5ivV2e4F4qzMSk8J2atSo84-IcR6IQe5z5uDYMhhR_6i-PJzWG6dgnTV6C_862NqpiQ7UXc11bLXIOT3R6tu3iiYJzVxHSB_fuYe9wQ5dMItjsyTYFH117VzrXii6ffqg1nSN3CVcfSyhTPodOxymiImomJzCkXzP33HBJpFIgoWkECJJRCcnEg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":2,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was born around 287 BCE in the bustling port city of Syracuse, Sicily, a self-governing Greek colony at the time.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":3,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Archimedes was born around 287 BCE in the bustling port city of Syracuse, Sicily, a self-governing Greek colony at the time.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"cr