g-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":7,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Some accounts suggest a familial connection to Hiero II, the king of Syracuse, with whom Archimedes shared a close relationship.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":8,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"archimedespalimpsest.org\",\"data\":\"Some accounts suggest a familial connection to Hiero II, the king of Syracuse, with whom Archimedes shared a close relationship.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYQ9IECRcg5emZqtq7ebCcRLFOfVoD4SRCmq7DA9dN-rsrqIbJnX4bUK1GTyEWMhOUh0Akmwy-VQyFMn_fPkIRDzje2hLauT5XS_Ve5B5ig_thgySNW-qWJ2LEpn5hyF6yF6VVrFg3NOTytukwXIDehfOC_aizzUZgJCVF\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"As a young man, he traveled to Alexandria, Egypt, a vibrant center of learning, to pursue his studies, where he likely interacted with prominent mathematicians of the era.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH02d0FjDkja4T50gmyFcef5C-ZvRcR5wUrEceF49Ik_pyYvfrDYUzMvEDKnZ61tXev01dkGYighmFX987tlXQDsNBGLjESSooOVmtv9f4VEN1r5TiDXaiDofL6AVkazziDmXDD5JaTErSndtiMLy3m8gNb4KqH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"archimedespalimpsest.org\",\"data\":\"As a young man, he traveled to Alexandria, Egypt, a vibrant center of learning, to pursue his studies, where he likely interacted with prominent mathematicians of the era.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYQ9IECRcg5emZqtq7ebCcRLFOfVoD4SRCmq7DA9dN-rsrqIbJnX4bUK1GTyEWMhOUh0Akmwy-VQyFMn_fPkIRDzje2hLauT5XS_Ve5B5ig_thgySNW-qWJ2LEpn5hyF6yF6VVrFg3NOTytukwXIDehfOC_aizzUZgJCVF\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"italianamericanherald.com\",\"data\":\"As a young man, he traveled to Alexandria, Egypt, a vibrant center of learning, to pursue his studies, where he likely interacted with prominent mathematicians of the era.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEVcq2fALQdUJyx-jVTjZE4KUu0athb7sMWEdJMdKX5x9pL9xi1tzp7bmJ1IhrYyjO2a6099p1NTmICLYX8D1dgtfRoaS6sKkm0tQmWUHJXHQs18wKJStCh5tLeBH01x_eY7EyVAeHegrFqr6LzN0SPzJTAen0NHefvq-sOzd-SW6mSKjv314XcunE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He spent the majority of his life in Syracuse, dedicating himself to thought and invention.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"archimedespalimpsest.org\",\"data\":\"He spent the majority of his life in Syracuse, dedicating himself to thought and invention.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYQ9IECRcg5emZqtq7ebCcRLFOfVoD4SRCmq7DA9dN-rsrqIbJnX4bUK1GTyEWMhOUh0Akmwy-VQyFMn_fPkIRDzje2hLauT5XS_Ve5B5ig_thgySNW-qWJ2LEpn5hyF6yF6VVrFg3NOTytukwXIDehfOC_aizzUZgJCVF\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He was killed in 212 or 211 BCE during the Roman siege of Syracuse.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Accounts of his death vary, but a common narrative, recounted by the historian Livy, tells of a Roman soldier who, contrary to the orders of the Roman general Marcellus to spare the great thinker, killed Archimedes as he was engrossed in a mathematical diagram, famously uttering, \\\"Do not disturb my circles.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Accounts of his death vary, but a common narrative, recounted by the historian Livy, tells of a Roman soldier who, contrary to the orders of the Roman general Marcellus to spare the great thinker, killed Archimedes as he was engrossed in a mathematical diagram, famously uttering, \\\"Do not disturb my circles.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHI365S3VCL7RkMuDVefqjGeivq76f6o-ztFV5lAwaNJV08wqzKBONhf-HPq2x-KJ9znN8NHGgrAl3Zh8IqMS-1_Y5AM7VrIyc6bPHpNWnM51wg2MYiFeP42FV_6gBNRmtvnI4PYev7\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"data\":\"Accounts of his death vary, but a common narrative, recounted by the historian Livy, tells of a Roman soldier who, contrary to the orders of the Roman general Marcellus to spare the great thinker, killed Archimedes as he was engrossed in a mathematical diagram, famously uttering, \\\"Do not disturb my circles.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsfO5tbnzcEvbnybSedPZGiiCT9KQnZrnEHxwbi52m1u8wRK8xhnbd4uU9G40z5XaBd6xg5gWPH_tipRZ1qJRfRgnl_fJnXBNezbfdMeCNLCmIelA_sjPgOvmW3DB1nJv14NQMQVyiiaoVlb00-CLVwb0Nr-Z4R7Lc3Wt9JlFgtzvE-KltiBJlOI6_B6BXYIzE\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"#### Mathematics\\nConsidered one of the greatest mathematicians of all time, Archimedes' work in geometry was revolutionary.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFWAEA03seJSglslk_Lo6-RV2qWoAA9f_U037m8ZeEEewyAF0W2xrgZyRLGOGKZzwtjon1f_C7NmdljH2Nb54E2YxgkD_9BsX-XDrcKp9gVQekp1QchOIbKIISkuYbi0DMQzA==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"#### Mathematics\\nConsidered one of the greatest mathematicians of all time, Archimedes' work in geometry was revolutionary.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERDLW98zZWY3bYdMoJcuIeVJ9OiXipreEMZ7q_5vtX-QuaCNljaSPWmQWjhfeCEsX5_4RG8RZO8Db3Z3-OXGaQk_RCS2mpLZVIKk-5La68bYVHHZZhYdLW1B5osIYh0kSqV_VHoSgY9Yu_PjDNhJyFQ69TX-4sCVQ=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" a precursor to modern integral calculus, to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures with remarkable precision.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" a precursor to modern integral calculus, to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures with remarkable precision.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFWAEA03seJSglslk_Lo6-RV2qWoAA9f_U037m8ZeEEewyAF0W2xrgZyRLGOGKZzwtjon1f_C7NmdljH2Nb54E2YxgkD_9BsX-XDrcKp9gVQekp1QchOIbKIISkuYbi0DMQzA==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" a precursor to modern integral calculus, to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures with remarkable precision.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERDLW98zZWY3bYdMoJcuIeVJ9OiXipreEMZ7q_5vtX-QuaCNljaSPWmQWjhfeCEsX5_4RG8RZO8Db3Z3-OXGaQk_RCS2mpLZVIKk-5La68bYVHHZZhYdLW1B5osIYh0kSqV_VHoSgY9Yu_PjDNhJyFQ69TX-4sCVQ=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Calculating Pi:** He derived an accurate approximation of pi (\\u03c0), determining it to be between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historymath.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Calculating Pi:** He derived an accurate approximation of pi (\\u03c0), determining it to be between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFWAEA03seJSglslk_Lo6-RV2qWoAA9f_U037m8ZeEEewyAF0W2xrgZyRLGOGKZzwtjon1f_C7NmdljH2Nb54E2YxgkD_9BsX-XDrcKp9gVQekp1QchOIbKIISkuYbi0DMQzA==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Sphere and Cylinder:** He proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of its circumscribing cylinder, a discovery he considered his greatest and wished to be inscribed on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Sphere and Cylinder:** He proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of its circumscribing cylinder, a discovery he considered his greatest and wished to be inscribed on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH02d0FjDkja4T50gmyFcef5C-ZvRcR5wUrEceF49Ik_pyYvfrDYUzMvEDKnZ61tXev01dkGYighmFX987tlXQDsNBGLjESSooOVmtv9f4VEN1r5TiDXaiDofL6AVkazziDmXDD5JaTErSndtiMLy3m8gNb4KqH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Sphere and Cylinder:** He proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of its circumscribing cylinder, a discovery he considered his greatest and wished to be inscribed on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsfO5tbnzcEvbnybSedPZGiiCT9KQnZrnEHxwbi52m1u8wRK8xhnbd4uU9G40z5XaBd6xg5gWPH_tipRZ1qJRfRgnl_fJnXBNezbfdMeCNLCmIelA_sjPgOvmW3DB1nJv14NQMQVyiiaoVlb00-CLVwb0Nr-Z4R7Lc3Wt9JlFgtzvE-KltiBJlOI6_B6BXYIzE\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Area of a Circle and Under a Parabola:** He rigorously proved theorems for the area of a circle and the area under a parabola.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   ***The Sand Reckoner*:** In this work, he devised a system for expressing and manipulating extremely large numbers, effectively creating a positional number system.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ancienthistorylists.com\",\"data\":\"*   ***The Sand Reckoner*:** In this work, he devised a system for expressing and manipulating extremely large numbers, effectively creating a positional number system.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFDIvr78TsumuBkrEsRG-oGwDGIV0ATzqWUFOoivr2V6M8v1q_kWRtdsRJhLK67srJ-p3QlFTxrxHgUD8kQNC31cqSwL484oKul-jV142GXZvKubcxr0YE4B_cM33AYgT01YLQ_A0Pqf61FW-ryN8Fbvavxjxi4wfy1XXjwdyjJdJaHyw==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"#### Physics\\nArchimedes was among the first to apply mathematical principles to the physical world, laying the groundwork for mechanics and hydrostatics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"#### Physics\\nArchimedes was among the first to apply mathematical principles to the physical world, laying the groundwork for mechanics and hydrostatics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHNfsGesNS0US2Zt5EmO2oZRBHagGfcsJn_v-aPat45YPhENkC-dZdX0FESPJnzmcQVI4nXha0ST54fFmmD8Th_veP-pJ__3pyxqmuOL6GWmjffXrbQR_iRJyU9EmuXZzc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** His most famous discovery, the law of buoyancy, states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** His most famous discovery, the law of buoyancy, states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHNfsGesNS0US2Zt5EmO2oZRBHagGfcsJn_v-aPat45YPhENkC-dZdX0FESPJnzmcQVI4nXha0ST54fFmmD8Th_veP-pJ__3pyxqmuOL6GWmjffXrbQR_iRJyU9EmuXZzc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** His most famous discovery, the law of buoyancy, states that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsxqvY8F5hIkBHCrb74ZC0kU6nI455U-1q2MrihQjHorC-dCbBE-gLiWBn-G3UFP0zDDzy0DQdh93XRQ1RtgsrCvMTaifEuMPIcUp_idWOPuNmBJtXZ22JYN0QTOT8sWDBhxFkAtD2B6NiE0qNaorU1VE-\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":36,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"The legendary \\\"Eureka!\\\" moment is associated with this discovery, where he supposedly realized it while in a bathtub and ran naked through the streets in excitement.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":37,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"The legendary \\\"Eureka!\\\" moment is associated with this discovery, where he supposedly realized it while in a bathtub and ran naked through the streets in excitement.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH02d0FjDkja4T50gmyFcef5C-ZvRcR5wUrEceF49Ik_pyYvfrDYUzMvEDKnZ61tXev01dkGYighmFX987tlXQDsNBGLjESSooOVmtv9f4VEN1r5TiDXaiDofL6AVkazziDmXDD5JaTErSndtiMLy3m8gNb4KqH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":38,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"data\":\"The legendary \\\"Eureka!\\\" moment is associated with this discovery, where he supposedly realized it while in a bathtub and ran naked through the streets in excitement.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsfO5tbnzcEvbnybSedPZGiiCT9KQnZrnEHxwbi52m1u8wRK8xhnbd4uU9G40z5XaBd6xg5gWPH_tipRZ1qJRfRgnl_fJnXBNezbfdMeCNLCmIelA_sjPgOvmW3DB1nJv14NQMQVyiiaoVlb00-CLVwb0Nr-Z4R7Lc3Wt9JlFgtzvE-KltiBJlOI6_B6BXYIzE\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":39,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided the first mathematical proof of the law of the lever, famously stating, \\\"Give me a place to stand, and I will move the earth.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQExxps9Osvn4GBTafmjC9rlJ4mEc2VSLMu3Xm2Chb7jNbWEtmZpLqfRsbUxmKNTZAFzE2kYHnd06l8KjC0JGbM4ZBkmSyUa09T4ensuKrRfteJ71aB0Qttwh5boa1uopC_VuNE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":40,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"youtube.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He provided the first mathematical proof of the law of the lever, famously stating, \\\"Give me a place to stand, and I will move the earth.\\\"\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQCJgOQg6XqxgYZhxjX_q4Hyz9O-vD-mIrztg20GMoK_Rk5xAgL7e7L2ool5C5MLSOgykF12RlIkER4eIcMw3znzJkGt7BaAvCUieqexItWkDGrag5bd6VQUrUmCFFzTxYqPReZsk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":41,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** He pioneered the concept of the center of gravity and developed methods to calculate it for various shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHNfsGesNS0US2Zt5EmO2oZRBHagGfcsJn_v-aPat45YPhENkC-dZdX0FESPJnzmcQVI4nXha0ST54fFmmD8Th_veP-pJ__3pyxqmuOL6GWmjffXrbQR_iRJyU9EmuXZzc=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":42,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"famousscientists.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** He pioneered the concept of the center of gravity and developed methods to calculate it for various shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEDMdhtbDkM3jmebvAzStnA9UiYILckRXKQ7ChF1u5p6df1r1ovI3PpIEkpnzoGhvJJGqAltM6fmx1RBaprHK4WindMtFRY0FQ1HWjPFlnTk6yGhRqbW5HVqmmv2K0fX1dudo4Nx09o\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":43,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Center of Gravity:** He pioneered the concept of the center of gravity and developed methods to calculate it for various shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERDLW98zZWY3bYdMoJcuIeVJ9OiXipreEMZ7q_5vtX-QuaCNljaSPWmQWjhfeCEsX5_4RG8RZO8Db3Z3-OXGaQk_RCS2mpLZVIKk-5La68bYVHHZZhYdLW1B5osIYh0kSqV_VHoSgY9Yu_PjDNhJyFQ69TX-4sCVQ=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":44,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"#### Engineering and Inventions\\nA practical man as well as a theorist, Archimedes was a prolific inventor.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERDLW98zZWY3bYdMoJcuIeVJ9OiXipreEMZ7q_5vtX-QuaCNljaSPWmQWjhfeCEsX5_4RG8RZO8Db3Z3-OXGaQk_RCS2mpLZVIKk-5La68bYVHHZZhYdLW1B5osIYh0kSqV_VHoSgY9Yu_PjDNhJyFQ69TX-4sCVQ=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":45,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"data\":\"#### Engineering and Inventions\\nA practical man as well as a theorist, Archimedes was a prolific inventor.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHqvIrJGQO3LgV3VdlQwg23Du09Y7bicrDbmUDnrRzM4Ydn95FSBVp5ivV2e4F4qzMSk8J2atSo84-IcR6IQe5z5uDYMhhR_6i-PJzWG6dgnTV6C_862NqpiQ7UXc11bLXIOT3R6tu3iiYJzVxHSB_fuYe9wQ5dMItjsyTYFH117VzrXii6ffqg1nSN3CVcfSyhTPodOxymiImomJzCkXzP33HBJpFIgoWkECJJRCcnEg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":46,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw inside a cylinder, was designed to raise water from a lower to a higher level.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":47,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw inside a cylinder, was designed to raise water from a lower to a higher level.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsxqvY8F5hIkBHCrb74ZC0kU6nI455U-1q2MrihQjHorC-dCbBE-gLiWBn-G3UFP0zDDzy0DQdh93XRQ1RtgsrCvMTaifEuMPIcUp_idWOPuNmBJtXZ22JYN0QTOT8sWDBhxFkAtD2B6NiE0qNaorU1VE-\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":48,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"cuemath.com\",\"data\":\"It was reportedly invented to pump bilge water out of a large ship and is still used today for irrigation and sewage treatment.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsxqvY8F5hIkBHCrb74ZC0kU6nI455U-1q2MrihQjHorC-dCbBE-gLiWBn-G3UFP0zDDzy0DQdh93XRQ1RtgsrCvMTaifEuMPIcUp_idWOPuNmBJtXZ22JYN0QTOT8sWDBhxFkAtD2B6NiE0qNaorU1VE-\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":49,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"study.com\",\"data\":\"It was reportedly invented to pump bilge water out of a large ship and is still used today for irrigation and sewage treatment.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpTDk3EiU6Hix5BIe2s7soL3z8Jwb1MZlCXO-yz7-NfMSJWa1FSJhRCBwUAmE8E36yYNbb-vbsVWWGa3t33oN3Alm5c-Fj41XxuODSkW2fvOBn1vVEjo9X7fJ6bsgCHiSvc67b20KT_SvUggnRIB9IfYSiApvk1AAsYsxNswu6XP8sNrCLTPC7vjJbmkoWCpjmrN1iUQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":50,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"It was reportedly invented to pump bilge water out of a large ship and is still used today for irrigation and sewage treatment.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEqkT1urNcaaVzmnANNTEkx79N_lT3nw43J3nabGAz2BTBx_uCAlk-Zw9B-P05Dg_DHZYj0_m0CkWevGDyEv70bhPtEtthBy9YGM5MZTwoEXNlY7ZwNEnpn_6Ex2PsUGoimSDJ8LJXRyG3dDSEbNO-CUjwnRXmSeo6XQpq8IfWYXPZIroXAjbkIjZ2cBQfpzxIdlNadQo94RU0yhOQH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":51,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Engines of War:** During the Roman siege of Syracuse, Archimedes designed a variety of ingenious war machines to defend his city.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbOwkJ3PxqIVdYEC0HiexykAiUoBXWuXP4Je-KH15GmHc2eyhpazhMV9YAAlfYaXqZvK4c58AUbPAJn71R79X-jmv9fPx5t1oumhYXjtzU2fn6I-xSxy-43A09mWKyiteTM36uZSHClEE8\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":52,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"archimedespalimpsest.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Engines of War:** During the Roman siege of Syracuse, Archimedes designed a variety of ingenious war machines to defend his city.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYQ9IECRcg5emZqtq7ebCcRLFOfVoD4SRCmq7DA9dN-rsrqIbJnX4bUK1GTyEWMhOUh0Akmwy-VQyFMn_fPkIRDzje2hLauT5XS_Ve5B5ig_thgySNW-qWJ2LEpn5hyF6yF6VVrFg3NOTytukwXIDehfOC_aizzUZgJCVF\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":53,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pbs.org\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults, cranes with claws to lift enemy ships out of the water, and a supposed \\\"heat ray\\\" that used mirrors to focus sunlight and set Roman vessels on fire, though the historical accuracy of the latter is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH02d0FjDkja4T50gmyFcef5C-ZvRcR5wUrEceF49Ik_pyYvfrDYUzMvEDKnZ61tXev01dkGYighmFX987tlXQDsNBGLjESSooOVmtv9f4VEN1r5TiDXaiDofL6AVkazziDmXDD5JaTErSndtiMLy3m8gNb4KqH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":54,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults, cranes with claws to lift enemy ships out of the water, and a supposed \\\"heat ray\\\" that used mirrors to focus sunlight and set Roman vessels on fire, though the historical accuracy of the latter is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHI365S3VCL7RkMuDVefqjGeivq76f6o-ztFV5lAwaNJV08wqzKBONhf-HPq2x-KJ9znN8NHGgrAl3Zh8IqMS-1_Y5AM7VrIyc6bPHpNWnM51wg2MYiFeP42FV_6gBNRmtvnI4PYev7\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":55,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults, cranes with claws to lift enemy ships out of the water, and a supposed \\\"heat ray\\\" that used mirrors to focus sunlight and set Roman vessels on fire, though the historical accuracy of the latter is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEqkT1urNcaaVzmnANNTEkx79N_lT3nw43J3nabGAz2BTBx_uCAlk-Zw9B-P05Dg_DHZYj0_m0CkWevGDyEv70bhPtEtthBy9YGM5MZTwoEXNlY7ZwNEnpn_6Ex2PsUGoimSDJ8LJXRyG3dDSEbNO-CUjwnRXmSeo6XQpq8IfWYXPZIroXAjbkIjZ2cBQfpzxIdlNadQo94RU0yhOQH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1758880740,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"0c4cf56b-7827-4ccd-84fb-7626c3920006\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":56,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"italianamericanherald.com\",\"data\":\"These included powerful catapults, cranes with claws to lift enemy ships out of the water, and a supposed \\\"heat ray\\\" that used mirrors to focus sunlight and set Roman vessels on fire, though the historical accuracy of the